tory_destination is defined\n    - git_username is defined\n    - getent_passwd is defined\n    - getent_passwd.get(git_username, \'none\') != \'none\'\n```  \n\nThis playbook addresses the yamllint errors by:\n- Reducing line length by wrapping and aligning items.\n- Removing trailing spaces in the specified lines.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-17T07:04:05.137502013Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 9182778212, 'load_duration': 69887427, 'prompt_eval_count': 1456, 'prompt_eval_duration': 7877248, 'eval_count': 554, 'eval_duration': 9104053181, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--f3e9be37-07c4-48b2-a3a3-d588711f2d71-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1456, 'output_tokens': 554, 'total_tokens': 2010}
